OL,3,GNEWSAVet bills force pair to change
OL,4,Adream castle wedding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Canadian couple have been forced to
OL,7,Fchange their plans to fly their family
OL,8,Fto the UK and get married at Warwick
OL,9,FCastle, after spending their savings on
OL,10,Fvets bills.
OL,12,FMadeleine Pincombe, 40, and Shane
OL,13,FDixon-Mitchell, 31, from British
OL,14,FColumbia, had hoped to bring their
OL,15,Fwhole family with them when they tie
OL,16,Fthe knot in April 2027.
OL,18,FBut when their dog Duke died after
OL,19,Fbeing diagnosed with a blood disease,
OL,20,Fleaving them with an 11,000 Canadian
OL,21,Fdollar (#5,830) vet bill, the couple
OL,22,Fhad to re-evaluate their dream wedding.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
